WEBVTT

00:45:30.167 --> 00:45:32.393
CA: Wow, that's powerful.

00:45:32.417 --> 00:45:35.476
I think all of us,
we all feel this weird mixture

00:45:35.500 --> 00:45:41.851
of almost guilt at how fortunate
a position some of us are in.

00:45:41.875 --> 00:45:44.458
Certainly a lot of gratitude, anger.

00:45:47.333 --> 00:45:52.583
Were you persuaded, Whitney,
by this idea, by the possibility of it?

00:45:53.958 --> 00:45:55.518
CH: Sorry, you're meaning me.

00:45:55.542 --> 00:45:57.976
CA: Sorry! (Laughs)
Did I say Whitney?

00:45:58.000 --> 00:45:59.809
CH: Totally OK.

00:45:59.833 --> 00:46:01.434
Whitney's your usual pal.